{"modelInput":{"anthropic_version":"bedrock-2023-05-31","max_tokens":1024,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Extract the following details from the job description:\n\nEmployment Details:\n- Type of employment (FULL_TIME, PART_TIME, INTERNSHIP, CONTRACT, etc.)\n- Department (e.g., hr, marketing, sales, tech)\n- Company name\n- Salary range (minimum and maximum values)\n- Years of experience required (numeric values for min and max)\n- Notice period requirements (in months)\n\nSkills Requirements:\n- Core skills required for the role\n- Technical skills required (programming languages, software, etc.)\n- Soft skills and interpersonal abilities\n- Miscellaneous skills that don't fit other categories\n\nImportant Instructions:\n- Extract ONLY information explicitly mentioned in the job description\n- Do not infer or fabricate any details not present in the text\n- For type of employment, use UPPERCASE (e.g., FULL_TIME, PART_TIME)\n- For department, use lowercase (e.g., hr, marketing, sales)\n- For company name, use UPPERCASE\n- For all skills, use lowercase format\n- If information for any field is not available, return an empty array or null as appropriate\n- If typeofEmployment or companyName are already present, do not update them\n\nHere is the job description:\n\nCOMPANY DESCRIPTION\n\nVisa is a world leader in payments and technology, with over 259 billion\npayments transactions flowing safely between consumers, merchants, financial\ninstitutions, and government entities in more than 200 countries and territories\neach year. Our mission is to connect the world through the most innovative,\nconvenient, reliable, and secure payments network, enabling individuals,\nbusinesses, and economies to thrive while driven by a common purpose – to uplift\neveryone, everywhere by being the best way to pay and be paid.\n\nMake an impact with a purpose-driven industry leader. Join us today and\nexperience Life at Visa.\n\n\nJOB DESCRIPTION\n\nVisa seeks a Test Engineer to join the Clearing and Settlement (CAS) Engineering\nDevelopment team, based in Bangalore, India. We need a highly motivated Quality\nAnalyst who is passionate on using modern software engineering and testing\nprinciples to deliver robust applications to our global users. We test\ninfrastructure solutions for business-critical high visibility projects. We are\nlooking for an expert in testing sophisticated and complicated business problems\nand testing applications. Experience in mainframe environment, automated\ntesting, CI/CD, full stack software design and development would be best fit.\nYou will be extensively involved in hands-on activities including analyzing\nbusiness needs and design documents, development of Test Plans, Test Design and\nTest cases, design walk-throughs, testing, building, and maintaining test tools\nincluding automated test solutions for multiple applications on a variety of\ntechnology stacks.\n\nThe Opportunity:\n\nWe are looking for versatile, dedicated, curious, and highly energetic Software\nEngineers who embrace solving complex challenges on a global scale. As a Visa\nSoftware Engineer, you will be an integral part of a multi-functional\ndevelopment team inventing, designing, building, and testing software products\nthat reach a truly global customer base. While building components of powerful\npayment technology, you will get to see your efforts shaping the digital future\nof monetary transactions.\n\n\nPrimary Responsibilities:\n\nBuild test tools to improve quality and performance of CAS.\nImplement test automation for Clearing application.\nSetup, configure, and maintain test environments.\nDesign and develop test plans and functional test cases from business\nrequirements and conceptual documents for CAS.\nComplete test cases, analyze, and report test results to project team.\nCollaborate with peers and other customers in Test design/plan review sessions.\nCollaborate with development team to analyze, debug, and resolve any application\nissues.\nApply experience and skills to tackle testing challenges including but not\nlimited to data management, test environment and application configuration.\nThis is a hybrid position. Expectation of days in office will be confirmed by\nyour hiring manager.\n\n\nQUALIFICATIONS\n\nBasic Qualifications\n6 months to 2 years of relevant work experience\n\nPreferred Qualifications\n• Manual Testing of applications deployed in Mainframe experience is must to\nhave.\n• Experience in SDLC methodologies (e.g., Agile, Waterfall,\nIterative/Incremental)\n• Comprehensive understanding in Mainframe testing, TSO, MVS JCL, ISPF, File\nAid, COBOL, SQL, DB2\n• Experience in test planning, test case writing and test designing.\n• Strong oral and written communications skills\n• Strong analytical and problem-solving skills\n• Ability to work well with a team in a high-performance organization\n• Experience testing applications on mainframe platforms, payment solutions on a\nmodern technology stack is a plus.\n• Experience in Jenkins, git, or other source control and CI/CD technologies\nwould be a plus.\n\n\nADDITIONAL INFORMATION\n\nVisa is an EEO Employer. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for\nemployment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, sexual\norientation, gender identity, disability or protected veteran status. Visa will\nalso consider for employment qualified applicants with criminal histories in a\nmanner consistent with EEOC guidelines and applicable local law.\n\nReturn only the following JSON structure with extracted values. Do not provide any additional content, explanations, or details:\n\n{\n  \"typeofEmployment\": \"string\", // UPPERCASE format (e.g., FULL_TIME, PART_TIME)\n  \"department\": \"string\", // lowercase format (e.g., hr, marketing, sales)\n  \"companyName\": \"string\", // UPPERCASE format\n  \"salaryRange\": {\n    \"min\": number,\n    \"max\": number\n  },\n  \"experienceRange\": {\n    \"min\": number,\n    \"max\": number\n  },\n  \"coreSkills\": [\n    \"string\", // lowercase format\n    \"string\"\n  ],\n  \"technicalSkills\": [\n    \"string\", // lowercase format\n    \"string\"\n  ],\n  \"softSkills\": [\n    \"string\", // lowercase format\n    \"string\"\n  ],\n  \"miscellaneousSkills\": [\n    \"string\", // lowercase format\n    \"string\"\n  ],\n  \"noticePeriod\": number // in months, if mentioned\n}"}]}]},"modelOutput":{"id":"msg_bdrk_01KemZJ45vt6F6x6pgsPfRxv","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"typeofEmployment\": \"FULL_TIME\",\n  \"department\": \"tech\",\n  \"companyName\": \"VISA\",\n  \"salaryRange\": {\n    \"min\": null,\n    \"max\": null\n  },\n  \"experienceRange\": {\n    \"min\": 0.5,\n    \"max\": 2\n  },\n  \"coreSkills\": [\n    \"test planning\",\n    \"test case writing\",\n    \"test designing\",\n    \"quality analysis\",\n    \"software testing\"\n  ],\n  \"technicalSkills\": [\n    \"mainframe\",\n    \"tso\",\n    \"mvs jcl\",\n    \"ispf\",\n    \"file aid\",\n    \"cobol\",\n    \"sql\",\n    \"db2\",\n    \"jenkins\",\n    \"git\",\n    \"ci/cd\"\n  ],\n  \"softSkills\": [\n    \"oral communication\",\n    \"written communication\",\n    \"analytical skills\",\n    \"problem-solving\",\n    \"teamwork\"\n  ],\n  \"miscellaneousSkills\": [\n    \"sdlc methodologies\",\n    \"agile\",\n    \"waterfall\"\n  ],\n  \"noticePeriod\": null\n}"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1410,"output_tokens":300}},"recordId":"01JVA02HS542C02SYVQSMEPPXQ"}
{"modelInput":{"anthropic_version":"bedrock-2023-05-31","max_tokens":1024,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Extract the following details from the job description:\n\nEmployment Details:\n- Type of employment (FULL_TIME, PART_TIME, INTERNSHIP, CONTRACT, etc.)\n- Department (e.g., hr, marketing, sales, tech)\n- Company name\n- Salary range (minimum and maximum values)\n- Years of experience required (numeric values for min and max)\n- Notice period requirements (in months)\n\nSkills Requirements:\n- Core skills required for the role\n- Technical skills required (programming languages, software, etc.)\n- Soft skills and interpersonal abilities\n- Miscellaneous skills that don't fit other categories\n\nImportant Instructions:\n- Extract ONLY information explicitly mentioned in the job description\n- Do not infer or fabricate any details not present in the text\n- For type of employment, use UPPERCASE (e.g., FULL_TIME, PART_TIME)\n- For department, use lowercase (e.g., hr, marketing, sales)\n- For company name, use UPPERCASE\n- For all skills, use lowercase format\n- If information for any field is not available, return an empty array or null as appropriate\n- If typeofEmployment or companyName are already present, do not update them\n\nHere is the job description:\n\nCOMPANY DESCRIPTION\n\nAt Turner & Townsend we’re passionate about making the difference. That means\ndelivering better outcomes for our clients, helping our people to realize their\npotential, and doing our part to create a prosperous society.\n\nEvery day we help our major global clients deliver ambitious and highly\ntechnical projects, in over 110 offices worldwide.\n\n\nJOB DESCRIPTION\n\nMain purpose of role:\n\nTaking responsibility for effectively delivering a range of tasks to high\nquality standards for fit out projects\n\nScope:\n\nSenior project manager assist on a wide range of Fit out projects of all sizes\nand dimensions.  \n\nResponsibilities:\n\n * Assisting the Project Manager on a range of tasks, to include:\n * Conducting background research, data collection and benchmarking\n * Establishing effective processes and systems to be utilised throughout the\n   project\n * Producing project plans\n * Monitoring and documenting project progress and other performance indicators\n * Tracking and documenting changes\n * Preparing written project communication materials\n * Preparing formal project progress and other reports\n * Liaising with the client, contractors and designers\n * Attending meetings and drafting minutes, etc\n * Preparing presentation materials for client pitches, etc\n * Inputting key information into the Turner & Townsend internal database\n * Reporting\n * Depending upon context, an Assistant Project Manager is likely to report to a\n   Project Manager or Senior Project Manager\n\nKey Performance Indicators\n\n * Tasks are completed to the right accuracy and quality standards\n * Tasks are completed efficiently and on time\n * Client needs are dealt with in a helpful and attentive way\n * The cross-functional team is supported in a helpful and positive manner\n * An effective contribution is made towards the overall project\n * Key information and data are effectively communicated and appropriately\n   retained\n\n \n\n #LI-PK1\n\n\nQUALIFICATIONS\n\n * Education - Diploma or B.E. – Mechanical Engineering\n * Experience in Fit out, Civil structural is preferred, corporate fit out\n   experience is a must \n * You should have relevant experience of working for a construction consultancy\n   in India, be degree educated in a relevant construction subject and have good\n   technical skills.\n * 12 - 15 years of post-qualification experience in similar role.\n * Excellent verbal and written English communication skills.\n\n #LI-PK1\n\n\nADDITIONAL INFORMATION\n\nOur inspired people share our vision and mission. We provide a great place to\nwork, where each person has the opportunity and voice to affect change.\n\nWe want our people to succeed both in work and life. To support this we promote\na healthy, productive and flexible working environment that respects work-life\nbalance. \n\nTurner & Townsend is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and\nare committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees and\nactively encourage applications from all sectors of the community.\n\nPlease find out more about us at www.turnerandtownsend.com/\n[https://www.turnerandtownsend.com/]\n\n #LI-PK1\n\n\n\nJoin our social media conversations for more information about Turner & Townsend\nand our exciting future projects: \n\nTwitter [https://twitter.com/turnertownsend]\n\nInstagram [https://www.instagram.com/ourturnerandtownsend/]\n\nLinkedIn [https://www.linkedin.com/company/turner-&-townsend/]\n\nIt is strictly against Turner & Townsend policy for candidates to pay any fee in\nrelation to our recruitment process. No recruitment agency working with Turner &\nTownsend will ask candidates to pay a fee at any time. \n\nAny unsolicited resumes/CVs submitted through our website or to Turner &\nTownsend personal e-mail accounts, are considered property of Turner & Townsend\nand are not subject to payment of agency fees. In order to be an authorised\nRecruitment Agency/Search Firm for Turner & Townsend, there must be a formal\nwritten agreement in place and the agency must be invited, by the Recruitment\nTeam, to submit candidates for review. \n\nReturn only the following JSON structure with extracted values. Do not provide any additional content, explanations, or details:\n\n{\n  \"typeofEmployment\": \"string\", // UPPERCASE format (e.g., FULL_TIME, PART_TIME)\n  \"department\": \"string\", // lowercase format (e.g., hr, marketing, sales)\n  \"companyName\": \"string\", // UPPERCASE format\n  \"salaryRange\": {\n    \"min\": number,\n    \"max\": number\n  },\n  \"experienceRange\": {\n    \"min\": number,\n    \"max\": number\n  },\n  \"coreSkills\": [\n    \"string\", // lowercase format\n    \"string\"\n  ],\n  \"technicalSkills\": [\n    \"string\", // lowercase format\n    \"string\"\n  ],\n  \"softSkills\": [\n    \"string\", // lowercase format\n    \"string\"\n  ],\n  \"miscellaneousSkills\": [\n    \"string\", // lowercase format\n    \"string\"\n  ],\n  \"noticePeriod\": number // in months, if mentioned\n}"}]}]},"modelOutput":{"id":"msg_bdrk_0125iZaefaQNCD4cAems7x9y","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"typeofEmployment\": \"FULL_TIME\",\n  \"department\": \"construction\",\n  \"companyName\": \"TURNER & TOWNSEND\",\n  \"salaryRange\": {\n    \"min\": null,\n    \"max\": null\n  },\n  \"experienceRange\": {\n    \"min\": 12,\n    \"max\": 15\n  },\n  \"coreSkills\": [\n    \"project management\",\n    \"fit out\",\n    \"civil structural\",\n    \"construction\"\n  ],\n  \"technicalSkills\": [\n    \"project planning\",\n    \"data collection\",\n    \"benchmarking\",\n    \"reporting\"\n  ],\n  \"softSkills\": [\n    \"verbal communication\",\n    \"written communication\",\n    \"english proficiency\",\n    \"team collaboration\",\n    \"client liaison\"\n  ],\n  \"miscellaneousSkills\": [\n    \"meeting management\",\n    \"documentation\",\n    \"progress monitoring\",\n    \"presentation preparation\"\n  ],\n  \"noticePeriod\": null\n}"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1483,"output_tokens":254}},"recordId":"01JVA02HVQX0QR8JGE7D74ZXWV"}
{"modelInput":{"anthropic_version":"bedrock-2023-05-31","max_tokens":1024,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Extract the following details from the job description:\n\nEmployment Details:\n- Type of employment (FULL_TIME, PART_TIME, INTERNSHIP, CONTRACT, etc.)\n- Department (e.g., hr, marketing, sales, tech)\n- Company name\n- Salary range (minimum and maximum values)\n- Years of experience required (numeric values for min and max)\n- Notice period requirements (in months)\n\nSkills Requirements:\n- Core skills required for the role\n- Technical skills required (programming languages, software, etc.)\n- Soft skills and interpersonal abilities\n- Miscellaneous skills that don't fit other categories\n\nImportant Instructions:\n- Extract ONLY information explicitly mentioned in the job description\n- Do not infer or fabricate any details not present in the text\n- For type of employment, use UPPERCASE (e.g., FULL_TIME, PART_TIME)\n- For department, use lowercase (e.g., hr, marketing, sales)\n- For company name, use UPPERCASE\n- For all skills, use lowercase format\n- If information for any field is not available, return an empty array or null as appropriate\n- If typeofEmployment or companyName are already present, do not update them\n\nHere is the job description:\n\nCOMPANY DESCRIPTION\n\nAbout Sopra Steria\nSopra Steria, a major Tech player in Europe with 56,000 employees in nearly 30\ncountries, is recognized for its consulting, digital services and software\ndevelopment. It helps its clients drive their digital transformation and obtain\ntangible and sustainable benefits. The Group provides end-to-end solutions to\nmake large companies and organizations more competitive by combining in-depth\nknowledge of a wide range of business sectors and innovative technologies with a\nfully collaborative approach. Sopra Steria places people at the heart of\neverything it does and is committed to putting digital to work for its clients\nin order to build a positive future for all. In 2023, the Group generated\nrevenues of €5.8 billion.\nThe world is how we shape it.\n\n\nJOB DESCRIPTION\n\nMandatory Skills:\n\n1. Native Hana Developer (Table Functions , SQL script, CV, Database Procedure),\nwith basic understanding of SLT/SDA.\n\n2. HANA Studio/Web IDE\n\n3. SAP ABAP, ODATA\n\n \n\nGood to have Skills:\n\n 1. Agile tool & ServiceNow for Incident\n 2. Basic functional understanding of Manufacturing\n\n \n\nDetailed JD:\n\n 1. As an expert SAP Native HANA developer, he/she should understand business\n    processes and technical architecture of Airbus SAP landscape and follow SAP\n    best practices and Golden rules.\n 2. The candidate will join the E2E Planning and Logistics Solutions team\n    providing digital solutions to manage business processes throughout the\n    Airbus group wide. As such, he/she needs to have a strong customer focus.\n 3. The candidate will work in an international, distributed and\n    multi-functional team; using an agile mind-set and methodology.\n 4. Good experience in Developing HANA Objects ( Table Functions , SQL, CV,\n    Database Procedure, ...)\n 5. Job Scheduling and Performance Monitoring on SAP HANA. Good in performance\n    analysis.\n 6. Knowledge on SLT/SDA\n 7. Preferable to have 1 year of experience in SAP ABAP or ABAP on HANA\n    development.\n 8. Experience in working with code versioning => HANA Studio , Web IDE\n\n \n\nTotal Experience Expected: 04-06 years\n\n\nQUALIFICATIONS\n\nB.Tech\n\n\nADDITIONAL INFORMATION\n\nAt our organization, we are committed to fighting against all forms of\ndiscrimination. We foster a work environment that is inclusive and respectful of\nall differences.\n\nAll of our positions are open to people with disabilities.\n\nReturn only the following JSON structure with extracted values. Do not provide any additional content, explanations, or details:\n\n{\n  \"typeofEmployment\": \"string\", // UPPERCASE format (e.g., FULL_TIME, PART_TIME)\n  \"department\": \"string\", // lowercase format (e.g., hr, marketing, sales)\n  \"companyName\": \"string\", // UPPERCASE format\n  \"salaryRange\": {\n    \"min\": number,\n    \"max\": number\n  },\n  \"experienceRange\": {\n    \"min\": number,\n    \"max\": number\n  },\n  \"coreSkills\": [\n    \"string\", // lowercase format\n    \"string\"\n  ],\n  \"technicalSkills\": [\n    \"string\", // lowercase format\n    \"string\"\n  ],\n  \"softSkills\": [\n    \"string\", // lowercase format\n    \"string\"\n  ],\n  \"miscellaneousSkills\": [\n    \"string\", // lowercase format\n    \"string\"\n  ],\n  \"noticePeriod\": number // in months, if mentioned\n}"}]}]},"modelOutput":{"id":"msg_bdrk_01U42cdaRfjzimLd15yixw7y","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"typeofEmployment\": \"FULL_TIME\",\n  \"department\": \"tech\",\n  \"companyName\": \"SOPRA STERIA\",\n  \"salaryRange\": {\n    \"min\": null,\n    \"max\": null\n  },\n  \"experienceRange\": {\n    \"min\": 4,\n    \"max\": 6\n  },\n  \"coreSkills\": [\n    \"manufacturing\",\n    \"business process understanding\"\n  ],\n  \"technicalSkills\": [\n    \"native hana\",\n    \"hana studio\",\n    \"web ide\",\n    \"sap abap\",\n    \"odata\",\n    \"sql script\",\n    \"database procedure\",\n    \"slt/sda\",\n    \"table functions\",\n    \"code versioning\"\n  ],\n  \"softSkills\": [\n    \"customer focus\",\n    \"agile mindset\"\n  ],\n  \"miscellaneousSkills\": [\n    \"servicenow\",\n    \"performance monitoring\",\n    \"performance analysis\"\n  ],\n  \"noticePeriod\": null\n}"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1144,"output_tokens":265}},"recordId":"01JVA02HW8CRHWXFAMZW7ZGHJ9"}